# Run 2026-10-31, boot A1 (superflat, grass at y -61, air from y -60): block, tag and fake-player rows.
# Needs the perfBot jar in srv/mods (prep_srv.sh adds it). Bot "qa" stands near 0 0 so every test area within
# 50 blocks gets random ticks (simulation distance 4). Toml set before this boot (plan step A1):
#   [monster_box] cooldownTicks = 200
# Areas: VS x 10..36 z 9..16, DM x -24..-10 z 10, WC x -26..-20 z -11..-9, MB 20 -60 -20, SG x -40..-14 z 30..34,
# CS x 30..40 z 30, misc x 40..70.
pace 2

## SQ-R31-BOT | fake player joins and reports
> gamerule sendCommandFeedback true
> time set noon
> pbot spawn qa 0 -60 0
> pbot status
expect ceperfbot ok
reject (?i)exception

